    "engine": "Opt-in pure ownership predicate selects callback-value hook only for native ModuleWrap records; ordinary module-record hook remains default",
    "promise": "Fresh Promise in actual referrer realm adopts callback result; native reactions forward value/reason to actual import Promise; pending edges traced by engine",
    "exceptions": "Synchronous callback exception stops source body, while invalid options/rejected callback values reject the import Promise with original exception",
    "attributes": "Engine validates actual options/getters/string values and retains complete custom/numeric attributes for owned dynamic imports. Static unsupported keys and non-owned dynamic import policies remain unchanged",
    "notALoader": "Upstream JavaScript owns actual module loading/linking/evaluation; callback namespace/value is not converted into a fabricated static module"
  },
